Privacy Policy for Cyber Save: Media Downloader
Last Updated: March 28, 2026

1. Introduction
Welcome to Cyber Save: Media Downloader, developed by Hashimaru. Your privacy is our priority. This app is designed as a standalone utility, meaning we do not use external servers to process or store your personal media files. This policy explains what data is collected by third-party services integrated into the app.

2. Data Collection (The "Standalone" Difference)
User Media: This app processes videos, images, and documents locally on your device. We do not upload, store, or have access to any files you process or download.

No Account Required: You can use Cyber Save without creating an account or providing an email address.

3. Third-Party Services & Advertising
To keep this app free, we use Appodeal for ad mediation. Appodeal integrates various ad networks (such as AdMob, AppLovin, Unity, and others). These third parties may automatically collect:

Device Identifiers: Google Advertising ID (GAID), IP address, and device model.

Usage Data: Ad views, clicks, and app launch frequency.

Purpose: This data is used for frequency capping, fraud prevention, and providing personalized advertisements.

4. Data Safety & Security
Local Processing: All core functionality happens on-device.

Encryption: Data transmitted by our ad partners is encrypted in transit using TLS.

No Selling of Data: We do not sell any personal information to third parties.

5. User Rights (GDPR/CCPA)
If you are located in the EU or California, you have the right to:

Opt-out of Personalized Ads: You can reset your Advertising ID or opt-out of ad personalization in your Android System Settings.

Consent Management: Upon the first launch, a consent window is provided (via Appodeal) to allow you to manage your data preferences.

6. Children’s Privacy
This app does not knowingly collect information from children under 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us immediately.
